{{DISPLAYTITLE:Perfumed Letter #1}}
'''Perfumed Letter #1''' is acquired by speaking with [[Gertrud Selind]] in [[Amberwood Keep]] in [[Northwind]].

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
Dearest adventurer, I hope you find my little game in good faith. Our fine Lady Selind is most assuredly distraught about her missing possession, but fret not, I will offer you a fair clue on where to find that which you seek.

Beneath [[Suspicious Pumpkin|the plumpest orange]] you will see something that should not be there.
}}

